4040 sur fond blanc).\n22  Photo 550 × 550, rayon 15, centrée (x 445, y 133).\n23  Fermer : icon-close.svg blanc, au-dessus du coin droit de la photo\n     (≈ 25 au-dessus) ; survol Orange.\n24 / 25  Flèches : cercles blancs 56, chevron Very dark blue, centrés sur les\n     bords gauche et droit de la photo ; survol : chevron Orange.\n26  Miniatures 88 × 88, même rangée que sur la page (445 de large),\n     40 sous la photo ; active : bordure Orange + voile ; survol : voile.\n\nSurvols visibles dans etat-visionneuse-survol.jpg.", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793832175607, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 506847474, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "ep-1d-t", "type": "text", "x": 11700, "y": 5200, "width": 1199, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "bol", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "1D · Mobile 375 — page, panier rempli, menu (mobile.jpg, etat-panier-rempli-mobile.jpg, etat-menu-mobile.jpg)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 168001631, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "1D · Mobile 375 — page, panier rempli, menu (mobile.jpg, etat-panier-rempli-mobile.jpg, etat-menu-mobile.jpg)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793832175608, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 986430851, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "ep-1d-frame0", "type": "rectangle", "x": 11699, "y": 5239, "width": 377, "height": 902, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "bom", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 282888696, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "updated": 1793832175608, "version": 1, "vers